# Force LF on every platform. The conformance/compat corpus
# (conformance/compat/v0.1.0/policies/*.json) is committed as LF-terminated
# canonical JSON and compared byte-for-byte against in-memory canonical bytes,
# which are always LF. Without this, Windows checks the corpus out as CRLF and
# the byte-exact compat check reports a false "BREAKING CHANGE".
* text=auto eol=lf
